WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Getting started with Quickler is simple.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.660
First, you'll need to set up a check.

3
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:10.640
To do so, you can either upload a form you already use, or paste in some questions.

4
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.840
Once the questions have been processed, you can check over them and make any edits.

5
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.580
Then, you can press continue.

6
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:22.560
After that you'll want to add your team with a name and phone number for each person.

7
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.500
You can also choose who does which check and when.

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.760
Your team answers on WhatsApp, says done, and the report is ready

9
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.280
for you to check and share.

10
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.080
You can try it free for 14 days with no card needed.
